## Interface: 16001
## Title: LefthyTools
## Notes: Small interface tools for WoW: Forever: Mirage (fades the interface when idle), Misc Tweaks, Beacon (friends on your map), Chronicle (your journal), Bestiary (what mobs drop), Echoes (records your journey for a replay) and Lodestar (quest chains).
## Author: lefthy
## Version: 0.7.0
## SavedVariables: LefthyToolsDB, LefthyToolsChronicleDB, LefthyToolsBestiaryDB, LefthyToolsEchoesDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Wrench_01
## AddonCompartmentFunc: LefthyTools_OnAddonCompartmentClick

